{"seq":3,"slug":"neural","title":"神经：把序数结构搬进深度网络","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/neural","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ordinal-neural","title":"神经序数回归：CORAL 与 CORN 的秩一致之道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/neural/ordinal-neural","wordCount":1844,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"consistency-monotonic","title":"一致性与单调：三个常被混用的概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/neural/consistency-monotonic","wordCount":2019,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"ordinal-loss","title":"序数损失：把「错得越远越该罚」写进目标函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/ordinal-regression-methods/neural/ordinal-loss","wordCount":1908,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"神经-把序数结构搬进深度网络\">神经：把序数结构搬进深度网络</h1><p>当输入是图像、文本或高维信号时，累积链接模型里那个线性预测就撑不住了——年龄要从人脸估、疾病分级要从 CT 读、评论星级要从文字判。神经这一章讲的就是：如何在保留序数结构的前提下，把线性预测换成一个深度网络，同时不让网络吐出自相矛盾的概率。</p>\n<p>第一篇聚焦两个代表性框架 CORAL 与 CORN。它们都把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 类问题变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 个「秩是否超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>」的二元输出，区别在于如何保证这些输出彼此不打架：CORAL 用权重共享强行让阈值单调，CORN 则改用条件概率链式法则，在不牺牲网络表达力的前提下达到同样的秩一致（arXiv:2111.08851，Pattern Analysis and Applications 2023）。第二篇把「秩一致」「秩单调」「单峰」这几个常被混用的概念拆开讲清：什么样的输出才叫一致、不一致会带来什么后果、以及为什么理想的序数预测其概率分布应当是单峰的。第三篇是损失函数的动物园：二次加权 kappa 损失、软标签（用二项/泊松/三角分布把硬标签抹成有序软分布）、单峰约束损失、以及基于推土机距离的序数损失，讲清各自惩罚「错得远」的方式。</p>\n<p>三篇是「结构 → 性质 → 目标」的递进：先有能表达序数的网络结构，再理解它应满足的性质，最后用合适的损失把这些性质训练进去。这一章大量沿用 <a href=\"../models/binary-decomposition\">二分分解</a> 与 <a href=\"../models/cumulative-link\">累积链接模型</a> 的思想，建议先读完 <a href=\"../models/\">模型</a> 章再来。评估这些模型好坏的指标（QWK 作为度量、MAE、accuracy-within-1）统一放在 <a href=\"../practice/\">实践</a> 章，本章只在把 QWK 当损失训练时才会提到它。</p>\n"}